            <p class="line">Are you unsure whether staying quiet is respectful or just avoidance on your part?</p>
            <p class="line">Worried that every well-meant question is landing as pressure instead of care?</p>
            <p class="line">You are not failing at this. Most parents were never shown what support actually sounds like, only what pressure sounds like.</p>
            <p class="line">Here is the difference, backed by what the research on adolescent stress and family communication actually says.</p>

            <div class="cta-pair">
